    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orthŏdoxus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθόδοξος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>orthodox</i>
			(post-class.): viri, Auct. ap. <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep.
			19</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">religio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 1, 2, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ecclesia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 1, 2, 14</span></i>
			.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orthŏdoxē</span></b> , adv., Rustic.
			c. Aceph. p. 1219.</div>
